2","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"僕は、彼女が発したその言葉にさとりとともに驚く。","seVolume":1,"duration":3.695215419501134,"transitionName":"なし","slideTitle":"スライド #42","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第20話_a180212b32\/元女子校の日常　第20話_a180212b32.042.jpeg","id":"01BA117E-5681-42C3-A53A-1E7333D23A6C","animationName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（驚く）.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_042_操夢.wav","seStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmVolume":0.7},{"voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地さとり","voiceDuration":8.185986394557823,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 43","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"私は、彼女が私よりも、彼を選んだことに、複雑な感情が湧き上がる。悔しい、嫉妬、欲望…私は感情の波に飲まれそうだった。","seVolume":1,"duration":8.185986394557823,"transitionName":"なし","slideTitle":"スライド #43","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第20話_a180212b32\/元女子校の日常　第20話_a180212b32.043.jpeg","id":"BDD36C92-C40B-4A96-B91A-2F76072D266C","animationName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%95%E3%81%A8%E3%82%8A","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_043_古明地さとり.wav","seStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmVolume":0.7},{"voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地さとり","voiceDuration":3.0613832199546485,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 44","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"「とりあえず、一旦外に出て、国際通りを歩きましょ。」","seVolume":1,"duration":3.0613832199546485,"transitionName":"なし","slideTitle":"スライド #44","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第20話_a180212b32\/元女子校の日常　第20話_a180212b32.044.jpeg","id":"233E747F-27EE-4AFF-A735-E077B19F4BA7","animationName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%95%E3%81%A8%E3%82%8A","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（不満）.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_044_古明地さとり.wav","seStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmVolume":0.7},{"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","voiceDuration":3.1778231292517005,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 45","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"「そうですね…、ついでに夜のお店も探しますか…。」","seVolume":1,"duration":3.1778231292517005,"transitionName":"なし","slideTitle":"スライド #45","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第20話_a180212b32\/元女子校の日常　第20話_a180212b32.045.jpeg","id":"AF325D95-B796-4F24-8AEE-442C45564711","animationName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/さとり（不満）.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_045_操夢.wav","seStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmVolume":0.7},{"voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地さとり","voiceDuration":5.8939909297052155,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,